odotengine/godot/pulls/119389","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119389","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119389.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119389.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-19T17:12:21Z"},"body":"Updates `qoa.h` to the latest `git`.\r\n\r\nBefore, `qoa_decode_frame()` had a mandatory `*frame_len` param, used to write to a variable how many frames were decoded. `AudioStreamPlaybackWAV::QOA_State::dec_len` was used solely to comply with it and isn't used anywhere else.\r\n\r\nBut this update makes `frame_len` optional as it now checks for validity before writing, so I went ahead and replaced the variable with `nullptr`.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119389/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119389/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}